msgstr "Kuskure yayin shigo da OpenCV2"

#: src/onboarding.py:371 src/onboarding.py:564
msgid "Try reinstalling cv2"
msgstr "Gwada sake sakawa cv2"

#: src/onboarding.py:382
msgid "No webcams found on system"
msgstr "Ba a sami kyamarar gidan yanar gizo akan tsarin ba"

#: src/onboarding.py:382
msgid ""
"Please configure your camera yourself if you are sure a compatible camera is "
"connected"
msgstr ""
"Da fatan za a saita kyamarar ku da kanku idan kun tabbata an haɗa kyamarar "
"da ta dace"

#: src/onboarding.py:455
msgid "No, camera can't be opened"
msgstr "A'a, ba za a iya buɗe kamara ba"

#: src/onboarding.py:467
msgid "No, not an infrared camera"
msgstr "A'a, ba kyamarar infrared ba"

#: src/onboarding.py:471
msgid "Yes, compatible infrared camera"
msgstr "Ee, kyamarar infrared mai jituwa"

#: src/onboarding.py:488
msgid "Camera identifier or path"
msgstr "Mai gano kyamara ko hanya"

#: src/onboarding.py:488
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Nasiha"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Error selecting camera"
msgstr "Kuskuren zabar kamara"

#: src/onboarding.py:582
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Ba za a iya buɗe kyamarar da aka zaɓa ba"

#: src/onboarding.py:582
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Yi ƙoƙarin zaɓar wani"

#: src/onboarding.py:597
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Da fatan za a ziyarci\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"don kunna ir emitter"

#: src/onboarding.py:665
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Saita hasken wuta 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:666
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Saita hasken wuta 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ba za a iya ajiye samfurin fuska ba"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Duba samfurin na biyu"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "An kasa yin rikodin samfurin na biyu"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"An ajiye samfurin ku na farko, don haka shiga fuska ya riga ya yi aiki. Dole "
"ne ɗakin ya kasance mai haske sosai don ganin fuskarka - canza hasken "
"maimakon kashe shi - sannan sake gwadawa, ko tsallake kuma ƙara samfurin "
"daga baya daga Saituna."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Bincike na biyu: tabarau, gashin fuska ko haske daban"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"An adana samfuri na farko: shiga da fuska tuni tana aiki. Samfuri na biyu "
"yana sa ganewa ta fi aminci idan wani abu ya canza: ka sa tabarau da kake "
"sawa wani lokaci (ko ka cire su), ka ɗauke shi da gashin fuska daban, kuma "
"ka canza haske — kunna ko kashe fitila, ka nisanta daga taga. Ka riƙe "
"fuskarka a bayyane kuma ka sake danna Bincika; irin wannan ɗaukar gajeriya "
"mai jagora za ta biyo baya."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska "
"(wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Ana duba kayan aikin TPM da kayan aikin..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska "
"(wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> An gano kayan aikin TPM. Ana shigar da <i>tpm2-tools</"
"i> kai tsaye..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska "
"(wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 yana aiki. Za a rufe kalmar sirri ta "
"amintaccen cikin TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} naka ta atomatik ta amfani da tantance fuska "
"(walat ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Matsayin TPM:</b> An gano kayan aikin TPM, amma shigar da <i>tpm2-tools</"
"i> ta atomatik ya gaza. Gudanar da <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Za a koma ga adana bayanan shiga ta hanyar manhaja."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska "
"(wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Ba a gano kayan aikin TPM ba. Yin amfani da caching na "
"tushen software (AES-256-GCM)."

