#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Hotunan fuskarka da Ubuntu Hello kwatanta da. Ajiye aƙalla biyu, rikodin a "
"cikin haske daban-daban."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Nuna samfura da aka adana don:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Samfurin fuska ɗaya kawai aka yi wa rajista. Tabarau, canjin gashin fuska ko "
"haske daban suna canza yadda kyamara take ganin fuskarka, don haka samfuri "
"ɗaya na iya kasawa (misali da yamma ƙarƙashin fitilu). Ƙara samfuri na biyu "
"da tabarau ko ba tare da su ba, da wata kamanninka, ko a wani haske daban "
"domin buɗewa ta ci gaba da zama abin dogaro."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ƙara samfuri na biyu"

#: src/main.ui:227
msgid "Models"
msgstr "Samfura"

#: src/main.ui:261
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Kamara"

