#: src/main.ui:430 src/main.ui:583
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Sanarwa"

#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Sanarwa ta tebur tana nuna yayin da Ubuntu Hello ke neman fuskarka, sannan "
"ta ba da rahoton sakamakon. Ƙoƙarin da bai yi nasara ba ya tsaya a cikin "
"lissafin sanarwa."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Nuna sanarwa"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Kati ɗaya kowane ƙoƙari na tabbatar da fuska, wanda aka sabunta a wurin tare "
"da sakamakon."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Sautin sanarwa"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Kunna sautin tsarin don yunƙurin da aka sani ko gazawa."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Haɗa bincike"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ƙara samfuri, tabbaci vs. kofa, firam, kamara da lokaci zuwa kowane kati. "
"Yana da amfani lokacin bayar da rahoton matsala."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Tsaro"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Yadda fuskarka za ta yi daidai, da kuma ko Ubuntu Hello zai nemi ka tabbatar "
"da cewa da gaske kana nan."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Tsananin daidaiton fuska"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Mai sauri"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Daidaitacce"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Amintacce"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "A nemi in gyada kai don tabbatarwa"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Bayan fuskarka ta yi daidai, sanarwa za ta nemi ka gyada kai. Hoto da aka "
"daga gaban kyamara ba zai iya gyada kai ba."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Buɗewar Keyring / KWallet ta Atomatik"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Kunna tantance fuska don buɗe keyring ɗin shiga naka ko KWallet ta atomatik "
"lokacin shiga. Wannan yana adana kalmar sirrinka cikin aminci, a rufe cikin "
"TPM idan akwai, ko kuma a ɓoye da AES-256-GCM ta amfani da babban maɓalli "
"wanda root kaɗai ke da shi. Tantance fuska yana saita PAM_AUTHTOK don "
"pam_gnome_keyring ko pam_kwallet5, gwargwadon tebur ɗinka."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Matsayin Yanzu:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Ana dubawa..."

#: src/main.ui:834
msgid "Enable Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Kunna Buɗewa ta atomatik"

#: src/main.ui:862
msgid "Keyring"
msgstr "Zoben maɓalli"

#: src/main.ui:898
msgid "Display language"
msgstr "Harshen nunawa"

#: src/main.ui:913
msgid "Automatic follows the system language. Changes apply immediately."
msgstr "Atomatik yana bin harshen tsarin. Canje-canje suna aiki nan take."

#: src/main.ui:936 src/main.ui:956
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Harshe"

#: src/main.ui:977
msgid "Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello"

